## 🧭 Decision Evolution Log

> Tracks critical decisions, reasons, reversals, and debates

### Decision #001 – Single Page Application Architecture
- **Date**: 2025-01-27
- **Author**: Development Team
- **Summary**: Chose SPA with state-driven navigation over multi-page routing
- **Reason**: Better emotional flow control, seamless transitions, simpler state management
- **Affected Modules**: All components, navigation system
- **Reversal Conditions**: If complex navigation requirements emerge
- **Status**: Active

### Decision #002 – Motion Library Selection
- **Date**: 2025-01-27
- **Author**: Development Team
- **Summary**: Selected Motion (Framer Motion) over other animation libraries
- **Reason**: Better performance, React integration, spring physics support
- **Affected Modules**: All animated components
- **Reversal Conditions**: If performance issues arise
- **Status**: Active

### Decision #003 – Progressive Disclosure Pattern
- **Date**: 2025-01-27
- **Author**: Development Team
- **Summary**: Implemented gradual information revelation for emotional impact
- **Reason**: Maintains user engagement, builds anticipation, creates memorable experience
- **Affected Modules**: All screen components, user flow
- **Reversal Conditions**: If user testing shows impatience
- **Status**: Active

### Decision #004 – SweetAlert2 for Modal Interactions
- **Date**: 2025-01-27
- **Author**: Development Team
- **Summary**: Used SweetAlert2 for "No" answer feedback instead of custom modals
- **Reason**: Better styling control, easier customization, consistent behavior
- **Affected Modules**: QuestionScreen component
- **Reversal Conditions**: If accessibility issues arise
- **Status**: Active

### Decision #005 – Dynamic Photo Loading System
- **Date**: 2025-01-27
- **Author**: Development Team
- **Summary**: Implemented optimized dynamic photo loading from public/images folder with intelligent stopping
- **Reason**: Automatic inclusion of new photos, scalable for unlimited photos, better maintainability, optimized performance
- **Affected Modules**: PhotoScreen component, image asset management
- **Reversal Conditions**: If performance issues arise with large photo collections
- **Status**: Active

### Decision #006 – Photo Flip Animation with Story Mapping
- **Date**: 2025-01-27
- **Author**: Development Team
- **Summary**: Added 3D flip animation to photos with dynamic story mapping system
- **Reason**: Enhanced user engagement, personal storytelling, interactive photo experience
- **Affected Modules**: PhotoScreen component, new FlipPhotoCard component, photoStories data
- **Reversal Conditions**: If 3D animations cause accessibility issues
- **Status**: Active

